# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Chokepoint — .gitignore
#
# DATA MODEL
# ----------
# Code lives here (GitHub). Benchmark suites and evaluation traces live on the
# Hugging Face Hub: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AnimeshShaw/chokepoint-bench
# so the two version independently and the data carries its own citation.
#
# `data/` and `results/` below are local working directories the scripts write
# to (dataset construction, evaluation runs) — never tracked in this repo.
# A tiny fixture needed for offline tests/CI is bundled separately at
# tests/fixtures/ and IS tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Credentials — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets.yaml

# ── Data & results — published on the Hugging Face Hub, not in this repo ─────
/data/
/results/

# ── Embargoed until publication ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The paper itself, and the two docs that narrate its specific findings
# (the audit's quantified numbers, and the literature positioning/novelty
# assessment). Kept locally; not part of the public repository until the paper
# is accepted/published, at which point these can be un-ignored. Everything
# needed to run and reproduce the harness independent of those findings
# (threat model, reproduction guide, AI-usage disclosure) stays public.
/paper/
docs/harness_defects.md
docs/related_work.md

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib60/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
MANIFEST

# ── Virtual environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.conda/

# ── Testing / coverage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.hypothesis/

# ── Type checkers / linters ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.pyre/

# ── Notebooks ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Local scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scratch/
tmp/
*.log

# ── Pre-audit code, kept locally for reference only ──────────────────────────
.archive/
